1 EDUC Rita attended St Chad's Primary School.
2 DATE Sep 1928
2 PLAC St Chad's Catholic Primary School, Blackburn Road, Whittle-le-Woods, Lancashire, England, United Kingdom
1 EDUC Rita attended the Notre Dame Convent in Blackburn from age eleven through her teenage years.
2 DATE 1934
2 PLAC Notre Dame Convent, Blackburn, Lancashire, England, United Kingdom
1 OCCU After leaving school, Rita took up clerical work and was a progress clerk at Leyland Motors for some time.
2 DATE 1939
2 PLAC Luke's Row, South Hill, Whittle-le-Woods, Lancashire, England, United Kingdom
1 RESI
2 DATE 2003-2010
2 PLAC Manchester, Lancashire, England
2 SOUR @S1499095236@
3 _APID 1,61579::56161085
1 EVEN
2 TYPE Winemaking
2 NOTE Rita's skill as a champion brewer of home-made wine. This nectar was served in lavish quantities.
1 OCCU When living in London, Rita became a civil servant with the Ministry of Transport eventually joining her husband Edward "Ted" at the Ministry of Defence, both of them working at Woolwich Arsenal until they retired.
2 PLAC Sidcup, Bexley, London, England, United Kingdom
1 RELI Rita was a staunch support of many societies, mostly based around her Catholic faith, which was never in doubt. She particularly used to enjoy 'The Catholic Women of the Year' lunch and the company of the many interesting women she met.
2 PLAC Sidcup, Bexley, London, England, United Kingdom
1 RETI
2 PLAC Sidcup, Bexley, London, England, United Kingdom
2 NOTE In retirement, Rita and her husband led a very active social life centred around the Rec Club in Sidcup. Together they won bowling prizes galore and Rita pursued her love of bridge to a high standard.
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 Jun 2014
2 PLAC Chorley and South Ribble District Hospital, Chorley, Lancashire, England, United Kingdom
2 OBJE @O10605@
2 NOTE Cause of death: pneumonia, dementia; certified by R R Khaw MB ChB; death registered on 27th June 2014 by niece Lesley Ann Astley of 30 Stansted Road, Chorley; occupation of deceased: civil servant (retired); usual address: Coniston House, Chorley.
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 Jun 2014
2 PLAC Chorley, Lancashire
