1 EVEN
2 TYPE Travel
2 DATE 1881
2 PLAC Woodland, Summit County, Utah, United States
2 NOTE In 1881 Henry moved his wife Mary Ann and her children to ‘Woodland, ‘Summit County, Utah, where they were amongst the pioneer farmers in this region.
1 RELI At Woodland he was set apart as Bishop of Woodland Ward by President Daniel H. Wells, 24 July, 1881, an office he held until 1885.
2 DATE 24 Jul 1881
2 PLAC Woodland, Summit County, Utah, United States
1 RESI
