1 _META <metadataxml><cemetery /><transcription>Queensland Death Certificate; Isaac Ogden died 1 Oct 1876 in Margaret Street, Toowoomba, Australia.  He was 84 years old.  His father was Samuel Ogden; his mother was alice Kelso.  He was buried in the Toowoo
2 CONC mba cemetery on 3 Oct 1876.  He was born in Ashton on Lyne, England and had been in "the colonies" for 35 years.  He was married to "Lucy" in Manchester or Ashton, England and to Ruth  Searle in Campbelltown, Australia.  </transcription></metadatax
