2 CONC ;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td class="bodyText"&gt;&lt;a href="churchhistory/library/pioneerdetails/1,15791,4018-1-41423,00.html"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thayne&lt;/strong&gt;,  Janet Gevitt Lochhead&lt;/a&gt; (68)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;&lt;im
2 CONC g src="ch/images/spacer.gif" alt="" width="10" height="1"&gt;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td class="bodyText"&gt;&lt;a href="churchhistory/library/pioneerdetails/1,15791,4018-1-39666,00.html"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thayne&lt;/strong&gt;,  Jeanette&lt;/a&gt; (10)&lt;/
2 CONC td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="ch/images/spacer.gif" alt="" width="10" height="1"&gt;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td class="bodyText"&gt;&lt;a href="churchhistory/library/pioneerdetails/1,15791,4018-1-39667,00.html"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thayne&
