2 CONC t;&lt;span style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;ALDEN&lt;span style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;(John&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/sup&gt;) was born at Plymouth, about 1624-25 (age at death); died at Little Com
2 CONC pton, 31 May 1717 (&lt;em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;"&gt;RIVR&lt;/em&gt;, 4:6:143) in her 93&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; (&lt;em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;"&gt;The Boston News-Letter&lt;/em&gt;, 17 June 1717) or 94&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/s
