1 _OID 1b3117ed-6009-463b-a0d7-341c7e87fe26
1 DATE 30 Jul 1792
1 PLAC St. Michael&#39;s Church, Church Street, Kirkham, Preston, Lancashire, PR4 2SE, England
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;Marriage William Harrison &amp;amp; Betty Ryley&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;St. Michael's Church, Church Street, Kirkham, Preston, Lancashire, PR4 2SE, England&lt;/p&
2 CONC gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;William Harrison &amp;amp; Betty Ryley, both of this parish and township of Freckleton married in this church by banns this 30th day of July 1792 by me, John Thormpson, curate.&lt;/
2 CONC p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;William Harrison's mark &amp;amp; Betty Ryley's mark&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;witnesses Thomas Mayor junr. &amp;amp; Ann Mayor&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
