2 CONC p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);"&gt;Admon granted 26 May 1681 to RICHARD ANGOVE, of Illogan, yeoman, HENRY ROGERS, yeoman of Camborne and HENRY CRAZE, yeoman of Illogan, guardians of MARY ANGOVE a
2 CONC nd CONSTANCE ANGOVE, sisters of the deceased, both in their minority. Renunciation of CONSTANCE ANGOVE, mother of the deceased (by her late husband WILLIAM ANGOVE the elder), now wife of ALEXANDER ROGERS. Inventory taken 4 July 1682 by RICHARD ANGO
2 CONC VE, HENRY ROGERS &amp;amp; HENRY CRAZE.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);"&gt;AP/A/410&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><
