2 CONC t;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'courier new', courier;"&gt;Henry Fleetwood &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; head mar 35 grocer b.Kirkham&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</li
2 CONC ne><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'courier new', courier;"&gt;Margaret Fleetwood &amp;nbsp;wife mar 34 &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;b.Kirkham (n&amp;eacute;e Jolly)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;sp
2 CONC an style="font-family: 'courier new', courier;"&gt;Edward Fleetwood &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;son &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 7 &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;b.Kirkham&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="fon
2 CONC t-family: 'courier new', courier;"&gt;Anne Jane Fleetwood daur &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;4 &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;b.Kirkham&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'courier new', courie
2 CONC r;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;schedule 75&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial
2 CONC , helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;65 Marsden St, Kirkham, Lancashire, PR4, England&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'courier new', courier;"&gt;Satorio Da Cruiz &a
