2 TITL William Ryding of Croston - Will 1658
1 _OID 2bd2f571-dde8-43a5-bee9-8b784806ccc7
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;The will of William Rydeing of Croston, made 17 January 1653/4 very useful.&amp;nbsp; Although no direct descendants, he mentions various siblings.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amongst these is a sis
2 CONC ter ELIZABETH, wife of THOMAS NORRIS. &amp;nbsp;Thus he supplies a surname for the &amp;lsquo;Elizabeth, wife of Thomas Norris&amp;rsquo; buried at Croston 12 Sep 1654.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;st
2 CONC rong&gt;Summary of Will of William Rydeinge - proved 1658&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Original scanned on Ancestry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 l
2 CONC fo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-hei
2 CONC ght: normal; font-family: 'times new roman';"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;Will of William Rydeing of Croston, being weak and sick in body and no
2 CONC t minded to die intestate, made 17 January 1653, revoking all former wills.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-
