2 CONC 19 Eccleston, Lancashire, England&lt;/li&gt;</line><line>&lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.25em; border: none;"&gt;Died: November 14, 1894 Farmington, Utah&lt;/li&gt;</line><line>&lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.25em; borde
