2 CONC e conversation on the subject of the great work of the Lord in the last days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;From the Autobiography of Heber C. Kimball, we gain the following insight into the conversion of the Moons who lived in that area: &amp;ldquo
