2 CONC om then until her death in 1896. She was widowed when her husband Thomas died in 1889.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: large;"&gt; ELIZABETH COWPERTHWAITE was born Mar
