2 CONC water S. side, 13 Miles&lt;br&gt;Wednesday 16 , Camped Sweetwater S. side, 11&amp;frac14; Miles&lt;br&gt;Thursday 17, Camped Sweetwater N. side, 8&amp;frac34; Miles&lt;br&gt;Friday 18, Camped Sweetwater N. side, 17&amp;frac12; Miles&lt;br&gt;Saturd
2 CONC ay 19, Camped Sweetwater S. side, 4 Miles&lt;br&gt;[Total] 54&amp;frac12; Miles &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monday 21, Camped Sweetwater N. side, 6 Miles&lt;br&gt;Tuesday 22, Camped Strawberry Creek, 9&amp;frac12; Miles&lt;br&gt;Wednesday 23, Camped Sweetwa
2 CONC ter last crossing, 10&amp;frac34; Miles&lt;br&gt;[Total] 26&amp;frac14; Miles &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Friday Sept 1, Camped Pacific Creek, 12&amp;frac34; Miles&lt;br&gt;Saturday 2, Camped Crossing of Pacific Creek, 1&amp;frac12; Miles&lt;br&gt;[Total] 1
2 CONC 4&amp;frac14; Miles &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sunday 3, Camped Dry Sandy, 9 Miles&lt;br&gt;Monday, Camped Little Sandy, 13&amp;frac34; Miles&lt;br&gt;Tuesday 5, Camped Big Sandy, 8&amp;frac14; Miles&lt;br&gt;Wednesday 6, Camped Big Sandy, 17 Miles&lt;br&g
