2 CONC d Black&amp;rsquo;s Fork, 11&amp;frac14; Miles&lt;br&gt;Tuesday 12, Camped High Land Creek, 18&amp;frac14; Miles&lt;br&gt;Wednesday 13, Camped Sulphur Creek, 20 Miles&lt;br&gt;Thursday 14, Camped A clear Spring, 9&amp;frac12; Miles&lt;br&gt;Frida
