2 CONC all-caps"&gt;Redfield. &lt;/span&gt;Approved March 6,1769. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-indent: 1em"&gt;&lt;font face="times new roman,times" size="3"&gt;In the name of God Amen. This twenty-second of September, A. D. 1738 I Theophilu
2 CONC s Redfield of Killingworth in the county of New London in the Colony of Connecticut in New England, being in a comfortable state of health, and of sound mind and memory, thanks be given unto God therefor, Calling to mind the mortalty of my Body, an
2 CONC d knowing that it is appointed for all men once to Die; Do make and ordain this my Last will &amp;amp; Testament that is to say Principally &amp;amp; first of all I give &amp;amp; Recommend my Soul into the hands of God that gave it, and my Bod
2 CONC y I Recommend to the Earth to be buried in Decent Christian Burial at the Discretion of my Executors nothing Doubting but at the General Recurrection I shall Receive the Same again by the mighty power of God; and as touching such worldly Estate whe
2 CONC rewith it hath pleased to bless me in this life, I Give Demise and Dispose of the Same in the folowing manner &amp;amp; form, my Just Debts and funeral Charges being first paid&amp;mdash;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="times new rom
2 CONC an,times" size="3"&gt;Imprimis I Give and bequeath unto Priscilla my Dearly beloved wife the use and Improvement of one third part of my Real Estate, During the Term of her natural Life ; and I give unto her one third part of my personal Estate t
2 CONC o be at her Dispose forever.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="times new roman,times" size="3"&gt;Item I give and bequeath to my nine Sons all my Lands and Real Estate to &lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="time
2 CONC s new roman,times" size="3"&gt;be so Divided among them that my Eldest Son shall have a Double portion thereof, and the Rest of my Sons Each of them a single Share to be to them their heirs and assigns forever. Reserving only to my wife the Improve
2 CONC ment of one Third part During Life as abovesd , my Said Sons being Daniel, Richard, Ebenezer, Theophilus, Peleg, George, William, Josiah and James.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="times new roman,times" size="3"&gt;Item What I have a
2 CONC lready given or may hereafter give to any of my s&amp;#39;l sons by Deed of Gift is to be accounted as part of their shares or portions of my sd Lands or Real Estate; as also what I have Layd out or shall Lay out to help any of them in building o
2 CONC r purchasing to be accounted as part of their Portions; so that the Lands and Real Estate which I shall leave at my Decease to be so Divided among them as to Include those Gifts in the above*! portions; and if any of my Sons shall Decease before me
2 CONC , their Issue if any be shall their share; and if any of them Die without Issue the surviveing sons shall all s&lt;span&gt;d&lt;/span&gt; Real Estate Divided among them in proportion as abovesd .&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="time
2 CONC s new roman,times" size="3"&gt;Item I Give and bequeath to my four Daughters all the Remainder of my personal Estate to be so Divided among them as to make all their Shares or portions of my Estate to be Equal Including what I have given or may giv
2 CONC e to any of them in the time of my Life, my Daughters being Elizabeth, Lydia, Priscilla and Jane.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="times new roman,times" size="3"&gt;Lastly I do hereby constitute and appoint my Loveing wife Priscill
2 CONC a and my Loveing Son Daniel Redfield, to be my Executors of this my last Will and Testament, and do hereby Revoke and Disanul all former Wills and Testaments and Executors by me at any time before named &lt;font face="times new roman,times" size="3
2 CONC "&gt;or made, hereby Declaring this and no other to be my Last Will and Testament.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p style="text-indent: 1em"&gt;&lt;font face="times new roman,times" size="3"&gt;In Witness whereof I have hereunto set my han
