1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;Will of John Kemmish seen at Hampshire Record Office 01.02.07.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;John Kemmish basket maker. Son Richard is executer. Leaves Richard all his real estates amd share of goodwill in business along wi
2 CONC th his residences and buildings in Southsea and his money except for &amp;pound;100 for his wife plus &amp;pound;12 per year for her maintenance if she lives with Richard. Any medical expemses to be paid out of the &amp;pound;100.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt
2 CONC ;He leave something (unreadable) in trust for son Charles and the rest to son James and daughters Ann, Sarah, Ruth and Kitty.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Will dated 4th Sept 1850&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;John died 03 Apr 1851&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;On 5th Sep
2 CONC t 1851 goods, chatels and credit of Joh kemmish do not amount in valued at the time of his disease to the sum of &amp;pound;100&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
