2 TITL Mary Etta Moon Obituary
1 _OID 4663b17a-7a84-471d-8e00-1c105de89656
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;Mary Etta Moon Wells was born September 20, 1864, at St. George, Utah, and was the daughter of Hugh and Jennette Nickols Moon. &amp;nbsp;She came to the Malad Valley with her parents when she was six years of ag
2 CONC e. &amp;nbsp;Her father died shortly after moving to their new home. &amp;nbsp;She was married to Erastus n Wells when she was seventeen and to this union was born 10 children, three of whom have preceeded her in death. Mr. Wells died in 1930.&lt;/
2 CONC p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;She is survived by the following sons and daughters: Mrs. Iva Lee Hoskins, Ogden Utah; Hugh N. Wells, Blackfoot, Idaho; Herbert T. Wells, Springfield; Mrs. Myrtyle Shelman, Springfield; J. Ray Wells, Sterling; Charles B
2 CONC . Wells, Springfield; and Lorin N. Wells, Odgen, Utah. Walter, William Ernest and Hannah Lilace preceded her in death. &amp;nbsp;There are 35 grandshildren and 22 great grandshildren.&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
1 _CREA 2021-08-04 09:32:00.000
