2 CONC &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;On the arrival of the body at the entrance of the church-yard it was met by the following clergymen and pastors in their robes:&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;
