1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;The will of William Rydeing of Croston, made 17 January 1653/4 very useful.&amp;nbsp; Although no direct descendants, he mentions various siblings.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amongst these is a sis
2 CONC ter ELIZABETH, wife of THOMAS NORRIS. &amp;nbsp;Thus he supplies a surname for the &amp;lsquo;Elizabeth, wife of Thomas Norris&amp;rsquo; buried at Croston 12 Sep 1654.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;st
