2 CONC &lt;!--[endif]--&gt;Brother &lt;strong&gt;Roger&lt;/strong&gt; to have the use and benefit of aforesaid legacy for term of seven years from testator&amp;rsquo;s decease.&amp;nbsp; After which, his executors to use the said legacy for the benefit o
2 CONC f said &lt;strong&gt;nephew William Ryding&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;lsquo;until he attain to lawful year of discretion&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;
