2 CONC To loving wife &lt;strong&gt;Margaret&lt;/strong&gt; all housing and tenement, together with moss ground and his more ancient tenement for her natural life, if lease continue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 35.7pt; mso-add
