2 CONC gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'bookman old style','serif';"&gt;After decease of wife, to &lt;strong&gt;John Cross, younger son&lt;/strong&gt; and heirs, all that moss ground lately purchased about an acre - with all tenant right appertaining.&amp
2 CONC ;nbsp; Also to &lt;strong&gt;John&lt;/strong&gt; one cow, or three pounds in lieu thereof. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 35.7pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -17.85pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&g
