2 CONC sisting of &amp;nbsp;about two acres of land, &amp;nbsp;in Bretherton, for remainder of lease.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 35.7pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -17.85pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;
