2 CONC ;Richard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'bookman old style','serif';"&gt; then to pay sum of six pounds, in equal parts, to two daughters &lt;strong&gt;Margaret&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Elizabeth&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt
2 CONC ;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 35.7pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -17.85pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family
