2 CONC amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'bookman old style','serif';"&gt;Should &lt;strong&gt;Richard&lt;/strong&gt; refuse to pay the six pounds, then executor to take possession o
