2 CONC mp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;First that any debts, funeral expenses etc.&amp;nbsp; be paid from whole goods.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]-
