2 CONC , gives that to him and his &lt;strong&gt;wife Jane, his sister&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-f
