1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.000000pt; font-family: 'times';"&gt;&amp;ldquo;April 3, went to Pittsburgh, put our things in a boat&amp;nbsp
2 CONC ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;by the name of William Penn. April 4, started up river, got to Wheeling at 6 o&amp;rsquo;clock. April 7, touched at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times; fon
2 CONC t-size: 11pt;"&gt;Cinncinatti. April 12, got to St. Louis. April 16, got to Montrose, saw my aunt Lydia (Hugh Moon the diarist&amp;rsquo;s mother&amp;rsquo;s sister) and brother William Clayton. He helped us to move our luggage to a log house hal
2 CONC f a mile from the river. April 20, we got uncle Thomas Moon&amp;rsquo;soxen and moved to a log cabin three miles from the river or rather from Montrose.&amp;rdquo; Thomas Moon was brother of Mathias and one of William Moon&amp;rsquo;s sons of Sherb
2 CONC ourn house. His brother William continued to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;lease the property in Eccleston and married Alice the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times; font-size: 1
2 CONC 1pt;"&gt;daughter of Jolm Mooln, a cousin. &amp;ldquo; Myself&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;and my brother John, and a young man by the name&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times
2 CONC ; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;of Henry Moon, who married my sister Lydia, went&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;out to work ditching, for a man by the name of Bosher.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font
2 CONC -size: 11pt; font-family: times;"&gt;We did not work long before we got sick of the fever &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: times;"&gt;and ague.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;/di
2 CONC v&gt;</line><line>&lt;/div&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
