2 CONC t minded to die intestate, made 17 January 1653, revoking all former wills.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-
