2 CONC nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;Soul to God, hoping to be &amp;lsquo;washed and purged&amp;rsquo; of all sins; &amp;nbsp;body to earth to be buried in parish church of Croston ......&lt;/p&gt;</line
2 CONC ><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-variant-
