2 CONC nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;To &lt;strong&gt;nephew Hugh Hodge&lt;/strong&gt; the rest of his woollen apparel.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]-
2 CONC -&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'times ne
