2 CONC as Norris and sister Elizabeth, his wife&lt;/strong&gt;, 5 shillings betwixt them.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: symbol; mso-fareas
