2 CONC s bequeathed to nephew &lt;strong&gt;Robert Ryding&lt;/strong&gt;, likewise a son of brother Roger.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: s
