1 _META <metadataxml><transcription>Per Persson born 1830 13 April in Asmuntorp. Came from Örtofta in 1854. Bengta Svensd. born 1826 5 May in Reslöf. Came from V. Sallerup in 1854. Illegitimate dtr. Boel Nilsdotter born 1850 12 July in Gullarp. Left: see p
2 CONC age 11, left in 1868. Both their son Sven, born 1854 9 November in Gullarp. Died 10 July 1864. Both their son Jöns, born 1856 17 November in Gullarp. Both their son Per, born 1859 6 July in Gullarp. Dtr Maria, born 1862, 28 January in Gullarp. So
2 CONC n Carl Edvard, born 1866 7 July in Gullarp.</transcription></metadataxml>
