2 CONC e as on the memorial; DAR records show he was born in Windsor, Hartford, CT and died in Farmingbury, New Haven Co., CT.        Inscription:  "In memory of Capt. Zaccheus Gillet. He was born Dec. 29 AD 1724. was bleft with a numerous offpring, live
2 CONC d refpected & died lamented January ye 7th AD 1793 in ye 69th year of his Age."     Burial:  Hop Meadow Cemetery  Simsbury  Hartford County  Connecticut, USA     Created by: Jerri Eoff Sudderth  Record added: Sep 20, 2005  Find A Grave Memorial# 11
