2 TITL Albert Sydney Westwood
1 _OID 8181f9fc-c4c1-4970-a091-7b79accc9f9d
1 DATE Summer 1982
1 PLAC West Heath, Birmingham, England
1 _DSCR Grandad Westwood was a brilliant, clever and very witty man, and adored by many.  He was devoted to Grandma Westwood (Ena Emily Clifton) for 55 years, and was a Chief Fireman during the Battle of Coventry in November 1942.  A buzz bomb (V2) fell 6
2 CONC ' away from him and exploded. He survived, though those farther away were killed. He was peppered with shrapnel, but more concerned about the firemen who were injures, or sadly, killed.  He was a full-fledged member of "The Greatest Generation", an
2 CONC d is deeply missed.
