2 TITL William Alvin Thayne
1 _OID 86b365b2-10a4-4624-bd53-3de3d59fc31f
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;font size="1"&gt;&lt;p&gt;THAYN, WILLIAM ALVIN (son of John Johnson Thayn and Elizabeth Hunt). Born April 13, 1865, Salt Lake City. Married Sarah Sorenia Tidwell Jan. 29, 1889, Wellington, Utah (daughter of Jefferso
2 CONC n Tidwell and Sarah Seely of Lee Co., Iowa, pioneers 1852, John Tidwell company). She was born Feb. 7, 1865. Their children: David Alvin b. Dec. 9, 1889; George Lester b. Jan. 8, 1892; William Azell b. Dec. 7, 1893; Della Sorenia b. Oct. 23, 1895
2 CONC , died; Elizabeth Sarah b. June 23, 1898; Horace b. June 7, 1901; Albert b. March 11, 1904. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Missionary to England 1895_97; Sunday school teacher; ward teacher. First surveyor of Carbon county 1892_94_96; first town clerk of Welli
2 CONC ngton four years; road supervisor; school trustee; assistant postmaster. Farmer and merchant. (From Prominent Men and Pioneers of Utah)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
