1 DATE 2009
1 PLAC Orem, Utah, Utah
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;div style="absolute;: -1999px;"&gt;Edwin Isaac Taylor 1917 ~ 2009 Edwin Isaac (Ike) Taylor passed away April 23, 2009 in Orem, Utah.He was born December 23, 1917 in El Paso, Texas to Edwin A. and Ruby Pierce Taylor
2 CONC . He is survived by one son and four daughters: Edwin I. Jr. (Patricia) Taylor, of Scotia, New York; Jackie Annette Black of Eureka; Rebecca (Dale, deceased) Tuttle of Orem; Dorothy Cheryl (Steve) Nickell of Galt, California; Wendy Duke of Yreka, C
2 CONC alifornia; 18 grandchildren, and 26 great-grandchildren, one brother, Verl (Marilyn) Taylor of Salt Lake City; one sister Ruby (Rex, deceased) Gourley of Cedar Hills; and many loving in-laws and friends. A viewing will be held Saturday, May 2, 200
2 CONC 9 in the chapel at 762 East 1200 North in Orem from 9:00-10:30 a.m. The funeral will follow at 11:00 a.m. at the same location. Burial will be in the Spanish Fork City Cemetery. The family would like to give a special thanks from our hearts to th
2 CONC e staff and residence of Canyon View Assisted Living and Alpha Omega Hospice for their tender loving care of Ike. Condolences at www.serenicare.com&lt;/div&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
