2 CONC om: 15px; line-height: 17px"&gt;Sex: M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 17px"&gt;Birth: 1763 in Of Cambridge, Lamoille Co, Vermont, (Germany)? 1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px
2 CONC ; line-height: 17px"&gt;Death: 21 MAR 1809 in Cambridge, Lamoille, Vermont, USA 1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 17px"&gt;Burial: Cambridge, Lamoille, Vermont, USA 1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</li
