1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: large;"&gt;He was a Police office in London, England. He was a husbandman of Dent in 1849. On the 1851 census he lived at Barbon, Westmorland, England. He was a farmer from 1851 to 188
2 CONC 0. He emigrated to US around 1872 with his family and was naturalized on 9 May 1879. On 1880 census he lived at Grant, Tama, Iowa and continued living in Iowa until his death in 1889.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
2 CONC </line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: large;"&gt; THOMAS WADDINGTON MASON, son of James Mason was born in Dent, England in 1822, and died February 3, 1889 at Reinbeck, Grundy, Iowa. Married to Elizabeth Cowperthwaite November 8, 1949 i
2 CONC n the Chapel of Killington Parish, Kirby Lonsdale, England by Robert Wilkinson, minister. He made his residence in Westmorland until 1872 when they immigrated with family of eleven children to Reinbeck, Grundy, Iowa. Thomas Waddington as a young ma
2 CONC n served on the police force in London, England. He came with only $500.00 and bought a half section (320 acres) of Iowa land. The eight boys(sons) helped with the farm work. He owned a threshing machine and made extra moneywith that. He gave eac
2 CONC h son a team of horses as a wedding present.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: large;"&gt; Thomas was naturilzed as a US citizen May 9, 1879 at Toledo, Tama County, Iowa
2 CONC .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: large;"&gt; Wasliving at Acclerigg Hall at the time of the English cencus of 1871.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;sp
2 CONC an style="font-size: large;"&gt; Thomas was living at Toft's at the time of his marriage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: large;"&gt; He also lived at Barbon after marriage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>
2 CONC &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: large;"&gt; This family is on film 1394296 at LDS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
