2 TITL Will of Margaret Moorcroft dated 30/8/1698
1 _OID 9444e8df-8beb-48dc-bd74-7f472b8a0b33
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;Margaret made, signed and sealed her will dated 13/8/1698 in good health and of perfect memory. "I doe recomend my soule unto Almighty God my Creator, hopeing through the alone merritts of my dear Saviour Jesu
2 CONC s Christ to obtain the remission of my sins, and my body to be Christianly and decently buryed at the sole charg of my Husband Silvester Moorcroft."&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;She leaves &amp;pound;10 each to Richard Whitle and Alexander Leig
2 CONC h her nephews,&amp;nbsp;&amp;pound;10 to Martha Leigh her niece, &amp;pound;3 to Wm Hill of Burscough and &amp;pound;3 to his son Thomas Hill. The remainder of the money mentioned as owing in the following schedule is to be divided equally amongs
2 CONC t Richard Whitle, Alexander Leigh and Martha Leigh. Wm Hill is to be the sole executor. The will is witnessed by Thomas Cropper, Henry Leadbetter and Ellen Hill.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Schedule dated 30/8/1698 of Moneys owing to Margaret:-&
2 CONC lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Delivered to Wm Hill to put out at interest for me, or for my use &amp;pound;10&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;One bond in the custody of the said Wm Hill taken in his name for my use and by my direction where in Thom
2 CONC as Prescot is to pay for my use &amp;pound;12&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Two other bonds in the custody of the said Wm Hill where in Thomas Spencer owes me &amp;pound;11&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;The persons hereunder named owe me the seve
2 CONC ral sums mentioned and all the said bonds are in my own custody and the custody of my husband Silvester Moorcroft:&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Henry Maudsley&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;pound;5&lt;/p&gt;</lin
2 CONC e><line>&lt;p&gt;Mr Gilbert Woosey &amp;pound;15&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;John Hodges&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;pound;5&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Margaret Far
2 CONC rar&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;pound;5&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;William Draper&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;pound;21&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Witnessed by Thomas Cropper, Henry Lea
2 CONC dbetter, Ellen Hill&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Certified by Tho Wainwright 2/6/1704&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
