2 CONC : 19.2pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Tarleton, linen-webster -- messuage and parcels of ground on S.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt
2 CONC ; line-height: 19.2pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;of the Oven Yord, now enclosed from the Haleffild and the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0
