2 TITL The Dedication of Cometan
1 _OID 9d673b5c-8131-44bc-aa78-6d42d5dade2b
1 DATE 1 Jul 2016
1 PLAC 160 Cop Lane, Penwortham, Lancashire, England, United Kingdom
1 _DSCR The Dedication of Cometan, also known as the Great Dedication, or simply the Dedication, was an incumbential event in the life of Cometan that occurred at the stroke of midnight on 1st July 2016, the day of Cometan's eighteenth birthday, thus signa
2 CONC lling his entry into adulthood. The event also heralded the beginning of The Year of Expansion as the fourth year in the era of The Founding of Astronism, making it the first incumbential event to be recorded in that annual life period.
2 CONT 
2 CONT At the stroke of midnight, as Cometan turned eighteen, he recalled as having knelt beside his window and look upwards to the astral night sky and officially bound himself to the founding, establishment, and dissemination of Astronism. This event wa
2 CONC s instrumental to Cometan’s determination in truly founding Astronism and it has been affirmed by the Astronist Institution that this singular event acted as the basis for the thousands of ideations that came to Cometan and all the other religiou
2 CONC s and philosophical experiences he recorded for years following in The Founding of Astronism era.
