2 CONC -&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'bookman old style','serif';"&gt;Also to Margaret all moveable goods, money, bills and bonds and other securities whatsoever, for her life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 35.7pt; mso-add-s
