1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style="width: 100%; text-align: center;"&gt;Provoan's Mother Dies in Jensen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mrs. Jemima Moon Dudley, 79, of Jensen, mother of Mrs. Wesley N. Robertson of, Provo, die
2 CONC d at her home in Jensen Saturday morning of causes incident to age.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;She was born Jan. 29, 1880, in Salt Lake City. She married Joseph S. Dudley March 2, 1902, in Vernal, Utah. The marriage was later solemnized in the Salt Lake LD
2 CONC S Temple, Oct. 12, 1905. She was an active member of the&lt;/p&gt;</line><line /><line>&lt;tbody&gt;</line><line>&lt;tr&gt;</line><line>&lt;td colspan="2" valign="top"&gt;&lt;a id="FALINK_3_0_2" class="FAtxtL" href="http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bi
2 CONC n/fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;amp;GSln=DU&amp;amp;GSpartial=1&amp;amp;GSbyrel=all&amp;amp;GSst=47&amp;amp;GScntry=4&amp;amp;GSsr=241&amp;amp;GRid=23032559&amp;amp;"&gt;LDS Church&lt;/a&gt; and it her later years worked in the Salt Lake Temple.&lt;br&gt;&lt;
2 CONC br&gt;She is survived by her husband, two sons and four daughters, Curtice Duncan Dudley and Orvil Andrew Dudley of Jensen; Mrs. Gerald F. (Katherine) Ross, Murray; Mrs. Wesley N. (Mary) Robertson, Provo; Mrs. David C. (Elta) Alder, Manti;; Mrs. Ea
2 CONC rl (Veda) Hatch, Vernal; 21 grandchildren and seven great-grandchildren; three brothers, Moroni Moon, Jensen; Charles Erwin Moon, Orem; and Harold K. Moon, Provo: Robert Moon, Compton, Calif.; Albert Moon, Oxnard, Calif.; three sisters, Mrs. Elme
2 CONC r (Leah) Heiner, Heyburn, Ida.; Mrs. Orvil (Edith) Gruwell, Blythe, Calif; Mrs. H. C. (Florence) Brown, Phoenix, Ariz.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Funeral services will be Tuesday at 11 a.m. at the Maple Ward LDS Chapel. Interment will be at Jensen.&lt;br&g
2 CONC t;&lt;br&gt;-Provo Daily Herald, Nov. 8, 1959, transcribed by Rhonda Holton &lt;br&gt;-------------&lt;br&gt;JENSEN &amp;mdash; Mrs. Jemima Moon Dudley, 79, died Saturday; funeral Tuesday at 11 a.m., Naples LDS Ward Chapel.&lt;br&gt;--------------&
