1 _DSCR St Leonard's Church is an Anglican church in Walton-le-Dale, Lancashire, England. It is an active parish church in the Diocese of Blackburn and the archdeaconry of Blackburn. In 1950 it was designated as a Grade II* listed building. Parts of the ch
2 CONC urch date from the 16th century and the nave and transepts were rebuilt in the early 20th century.
