2 CONC , 0.0.39; 187, Pie Brook, 6.3.30; 188, Woodcock meadow, 4.1.10; 189, Near Acre, 5.1.13; 190, &amp;lsquo;.Far Acre, 3.2.21; 218, Middle meadow, 2.1.38; 219, Long meadow, 4.2.2; 238,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times;"&gt;Padd
2 CONC y field, 3.1.38; 635, Green Croft, 1.1.2; total 41.1.1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times;"&gt;WoodcocI&amp;lt;&amp;rsquo;swas disposed of by mortgage and sale &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: times;"&gt;in the las
