2 CONC ggie Corney1893-1971)  (Hannah Cookson 1888-1944) ( Rose mary gutteridge1900-1974)     Peggy is carrying Paul’s dad Stephen or Paul’s aunt Edith          THIRD ROW from rear LEFT TO RIGHT  2 males 3 females all seated  (Annie Gutteridge 1893-1956
2 CONC )  (Bob Gutteridge 1860-? ) (Martha Dawson 1873 ? ) (William Gutteridge 1867-1945) (Isabell Roper 1868-1931)      FRONT ROW LEFT TO RIGHT 3  seated  1   standing  (Unknown female This could be Walburga Gutteridge 1898-1977) (Isabella Gutteridge 190
2 CONC 4-1996) (Honora Gutteridge 1890-1979) (Winnifred Turner 1917-1983) I think Harry Turner must have taken this photo.
