2 CONC less victory - the taking of Fort Ticonderoga.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;It may be interesting to his descendants to know the part Capt. Phelps acted as a spy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</
