2 CONT According to Kathy McConnell Hudson, Capt. Zacheus Gillette (the spelling in the DAR database) was present at the Lexington alarm and is a recognized DAR veteran. The birth and death dates are the same as on the memorial; DAR records show he was bo
2 CONC rn in Windsor, Hartford, CT and died in Farmingbury, New Haven Co., CT.
2 CONT  
2 CONT  
2 CONT Inscription:
2 CONT "In memory of Capt. Zaccheus Gillet. He was born Dec. 29 AD 1724. was bleft with a numerous offpring, lived refpected & died lamented January ye 7th AD 1793 in ye 69th year of his Age."
2 CONT  
