2 TITL William Forshaw of Lathom and Burscough - Will 1731
1 _OID ddf164ee-521e-42a7-b862-b32416d0f30a
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;William&amp;rsquo;s will is interesting. Long and somewhat complicated. He would appear to have been very comfortably off
2 CONC . &amp;nbsp;Although he lived in Lathom, he also had land in Burscough. He seems to have purchased much land, possibly wishing to leave his four sons with real estate and also to provide for his two daughters. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/
2 CONC p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14.0pt;"&gt;Best of all, though, he provides a suitable Dorothy Forshaw to marry Thomas Jenkinson at Ormskirk 1716.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</lin
2 CONC e><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-
2 CONC size: 12.0pt;"&gt;Summary of Will of William Forshaw of Lathom 1731&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;Held at Preston Archi
2 CONC ves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;Will Made:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 22 Mar 1730/1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</
2 CONC line><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;Burial:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 26 Mar 173
2 CONC 1 (Rufford)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;Probate:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 2
2 CONC 9 Oct 1731&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -72pt;"&gt;Exe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;spa
2 CONC n style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -72pt;"&gt;Executors:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -72pt;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent
2 CONC : -72pt;"&gt;Edward, Henry and Robert Forshaw, his sons.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 72.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-indent: -72.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;
2 CONC p style="margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 35.7pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 12.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -
2 CONC 17.85pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-var
2 CONC iant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'times new roman';"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;
2 CONC span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;"&gt;Will of &lt;strong&gt;William Forshaw of Lathom, Yeoman, &lt;/strong&gt;made 22 March 1730/1, knowing the uncertainty of this transitory life and&amp;nbsp; being desirous of settling things in o
2 CONC rder.....&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol
2 CONC ; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'times new roman';"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp
2 CONC ;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;"&gt;Soul to Almighty God, body to be decently buried etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt
2 CONC ; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-variant-nu
