2 CONC yle="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;"&gt;Debts, funeral expenses, charges of probate to be paid out of household and husbandry goods and cattels. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;
2 CONC "&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch
2 CONC : normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'times new roman';"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; lin
2 CONC e-height: 115%;"&gt;Possessed of several leasehold Messuages and Tenements in Lathom and Burscough. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="
2 CONC font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: symbol;"&gt;&amp;middot;&lt;span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-
2 CONC family: 'times new roman';"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;"&gt;To &lt;strong&gt;wife Elizabeth&
2 CONC lt;/strong&gt; the house where dwells and the two chambers and buttery at higher end of said house and rooms over them. Also the house yard and half of the yearly fruit grown there. For natural life, providing she doesn&amp;rsquo;t remarry.&lt;/spa
2 CONC n&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: symbol; mso-bidi-font-fa
