1 _DSCR Utah was settled by Mormon pioneers in 1847, and it became the 45th state in 1896. This database contains a four-book series published in 1919. The first volume is a history of the state from before the Mormon settlers arrived through about 1920. T
2 CONC he last three volumes contain biographical sketches of prominent people throughout the state. For those researching early Utah history, this will be a helpful database.
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line /><line>&lt;tbody&gt;</line><line>&lt;tr id="sRes-0" class="tblrow record" style="border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: #cdc7be;" valign="top"&gt;</line><line>&lt;td style="margin: 0p
