2 CONC f the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints, in which he has taken active and helpful part and is now a high priest. His political endorsement is given to the democratic party. His fellow townsmen attest the fact that his sterling qualities a
2 CONC re many and speak of him in terms of warm regard.&lt;/td&gt;</line><line>&lt;/tr&gt;</line><line>&lt;/tbody&gt;</line><line>&lt;/table&gt;</line><line>&lt;/td&gt;</line><line>&lt;/tr&gt;</line><line>&lt;/tbody&gt;</line><line /></content></metadata
