2 CONC r similar spellings on that site, such as Donbabin or Dunbobbin. RG6 Quaker Burial Records show Jane, wife of William of Mobberley. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: medium;"&gt;The Ancestors and Descendants o
