1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>VERNAL--Mrs. Helen Merrill Richardson, 79, died in a Vernal hospital Wednesday at 3 a.m. after a short illness. </line><line /><line>Born August 6, 1880, in Uintah County, to Porter William and Harriett Remington Merrill
2 CONC . Married David F. Richardson July 27, 1910, in Vernal. Marriage later solemnized in Salt Lake Temple. Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints. He died January 24, 1915 in Vernal. Active LDS.</line><line /><line>Survivors: two sons, William F.
2 CONC , Archie S., Vernal; seven grandchildren; six great-grandchildren; three sisters and two brothers. Funeral Friday 11 a.m. in Naples Ward LDS Ward Chapel. Friends call Vernal Mortuary Thursday from 7 to 9 p.m. Thursday and Friday prior to services
2 CONC . Burial in Jensen Cemetery.</line><line /><line>-Salt Lake Tribune, August 20, 1959, transribed by Rhonda Holton</line></content></metadataxml>
