1 _DSCR This portrait of Ralph and Agnes Moon (née Taylor) taken in 1858 is currently the oldest picture in Cometanic ancestry.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Provenance: the picture was passed down to Ralph and Agnes' son John who passed it to his daughter Elizabeth, who in turn passed it to her daughter Teresa who then passed it to her daughter Mary who showed Cometan this image but had no idea who the
