2 CONC d who married Delilah Jones; George Merlin who is married to Viola Thomas and both are living in Malad, Idaho; Elmer Mosiah Ward who married Susan Irene Thomas; Elizabeth Ward who married Luther Owens Daniels and is now remarried; John Clesmer War
2 CONC d who married Eliza Lilly Thomas; and Charles Wilford Ward. In 1944, they adopted their grandson Eldon Thompson Ward who married Lois Jean Andrews. Jesse N. Ward died the 25th of April 1955 at the family home. He was buried at Malad, Idaho. Julia d
