2 CONC ed over night at a farm house some little distance from the fort.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div&gt;Some British soldiers occupied rooms adjoining Capt. Phelps, where they were having a dinne
