1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: #181a1c; font-family: 'source sans pro', 'helvetica neue', arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;Birth: Aug. 6, 1880 Whiterocks Uintah County Utah, USA Death: Aug
2 CONC . 19, 1959 Vernal Uintah County Utah, USA VERNAL--Mrs. Helen Merrill Richardson, 79, died in a Vernal hospital Wednesday at 3 a.m. after a short illness. Born August 6, 1880, in Uintah County, to Porter William and Harriett Remington Merrill. Marri
2 CONC ed David F. Richardson July 27, 1910, in Vernal. Marriage later solemnized in Salt Lake Temple. Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints. He died January 24, 1915 in Vernal. Active LDS. Survivors: two sons, William F., Archie S., Vernal; seven g
2 CONC randchildren; six great-grandchildren; three sisters and two brothers. Funeral Friday 11 a.m. in Naples Ward LDS Ward Chapel. Friends call Vernal Mortuary Thursday from 7 to 9 p.m. Thursday and Friday prior to services. Burial in Jensen Cemetery. -
2 CONC Salt Lake Tribune, August 20, 1959, transribed by Rhonda Holton Family links: Parents: Porter William Merrell (1846 - 1884) Harriet Amelia Remington Merrell (1854 - 1934) Spouse: David Fisher Richardson (1865 - 1915)* Children: Archie Squire Richar
2 CONC dson (1914 - 1977)* Siblings: William Porter Merrell (1869 - 1930)* Rose Amelia Merrell Eaton (1871 - 1961)* Josephine Remington Merrell Goodrich (1872 - 1954)* Lydia Remington Merrell Goodrich (1876 - 1973)* Fuller Remington Merrell (1877 - 1963)
2 CONC * Helen Merrell Richardson (1880 - 1959) Roxana Remington Merrell Mott (1880 - 1952)* Charles Elwin Merrell (1882 - 1968)* Franklin Remington Merrell (1884 - 1968)* *Calculated relationship Burial: Jensen Cemetery Jensen (Uintah County) Uintah Coun
2 CONC ty Utah, USA Created by: Bob Rohwedder Record added: Nov 22, 2007 Find A Grave Memorial# 23031484&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
