2 CONC dent of Vernal 25 years, died  Monday at 8:40 a.m. in a Salt Lake hospital after a two weeks illness.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;She  was born Feb. 10, 1885, at Lake Shore, Utah County, a daughter of  Andrew and Mary Lucy Markham Dudley. She was married t
